meta {
  name: tag: gatus tapis postgres (stack)
  type: http
  seq: 20
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/pods/templates/gatus/tags
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Tapis-Token: {{X-Tapis-Token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "kind": "stack",
    "stack_definition": {
      "restart_policy": "ordered",
      "secret_map": {
        "PG_PASSWORD": "${pods:random:32}",
        "BASE_URL": "${:?Tapis tenant base URL used for every request, e.g. https://tacc.tapis.io}",
        "JWT": "${:?Valid USER JWT (NOT a service account) for the auth-required list checks}",
        "AUTHN_USERNAME": "${:?Username for the Authenticator token-create check (NOT a service account)}",
        "AUTHN_PASSWORD": "${:?Password for AUTHN_USERNAME}"
      },
      "members": [
        {
          "name": "db",
          "image": "postgres:17-alpine",
          "description": "Postgres 17 for gatus check history. local_only - never exposed outside the cluster.",
          "ready_condition": "ready",
          "time_to_stop_default": -1,
          "networking": {
            "default": {
              "protocol": "local_only",
              "port": 5432,
              "tapis_auth": false
            }
          },
          "healthchecks": {
            "readiness": {
              "exec_command": [
                "pg_isready",
                "-U",
                "gatus",
                "-d",
                "gatus"
              ],
              "initial_delay_seconds": 5,
              "period_seconds": 5
            },
            "networking_requires_ready": false
          },
          "environment_variables": {
            "POSTGRES_DB": "gatus",
            "POSTGRES_USER": "gatus",
            "POSTGRES_PASSWORD": "${stack:secrets:PG_PASSWORD}",
            "PGDATA": "/var/lib/postgresql/data/pgdata"
          },
          "resources": {
            "cpu_request": 250,
            "cpu_limit": 2000,
            "mem_request": 256,
            "mem_limit": 2048
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "app",
          "image": "twinproduction/gatus:v5.36.0",
          "description": "Gatus v5.36.0 rendering the full Tapis status board (21 checks across 15 services). Postgres storage - check history survives restarts, no tapisvolume needed.",
          "depends_on": [
            "db"
          ],
          "time_to_stop_default": -1,
          "environment_variables": {
            "GATUS_DB_HOST": "${stack:db:host}",
            "GATUS_DB_PORT": "5432",
            "GATUS_DB_USER": "gatus",
            "GATUS_DB_NAME": "gatus",
            "GATUS_DB_PASSWORD": "${stack:secrets:PG_PASSWORD}"
          },
          "secret_map": {
            "BASE_URL": "${stack:secrets:BASE_URL}",
            "JWT": "${stack:secrets:JWT}",
            "AUTHN_USERNAME": "${stack:secrets:AUTHN_USERNAME}",
            "AUTHN_PASSWORD": "${stack:secrets:AUTHN_PASSWORD}",
            "DISPLAY": "${pods:default:Tapis:?Tenant label appended to each check name, e.g. TACC}",
            "HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL": "${pods:default:15s:?How often to poll /healthcheck endpoints (default 15s)}",
            "SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL": "${pods:default:60s:?How often to poll auth-required service/list endpoints (default 60s)}"
          },
          "volume_mounts": {
            "/config/config.yaml": {
              "type": "ephemeral",
              "read_only": false,
              "config_permissions": "0644",
              "config_filename": "config.yaml",
              "config_update_mode": "always",
              "config_content": "# Tapis status board - rendered from tapis/status-config-builder for ONE tenant.\n# ${pods:secrets:KEY} placeholders are filled by the Pods service from secret_map at instantiation.\n# ${VAR} (GATUS_DB_*) is expanded by gatus itself from environment_variables at startup.\nstorage:\n  type: postgres\n  path: \"host=${GATUS_DB_HOST} port=${GATUS_DB_PORT} user=${GATUS_DB_USER} password='${GATUS_DB_PASSWORD}' dbname=${GATUS_DB_NAME} sslmode=disable\"\n\nweb:\n  port: 8080\n\nui:\n  title: Tapis Status | ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n  header: Tapis Service Status\n\nendpoints:\n  - name: Systems HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/systems/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Systems\n  - name: Systems List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/systems\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Systems\n  - name: Apps HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/apps/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Apps\n  - name: Apps List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/apps\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Apps\n  - name: Jobs HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/jobs/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Jobs\n  - name: Jobs List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/jobs/list\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Jobs\n  - name: Notifications HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/notifications/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Notifications\n  - name: Notifications Subscriptions List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/notifications/subscriptions\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Notifications\n  - name: Files HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/files/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Files\n  - name: Meta HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/meta/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Meta\n  - name: SK HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/security/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Security Kernel\n  - name: Tenants List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Tenants\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/tenants\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Tokens Ready ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Tokens\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/tokens/ready\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Streams Ready ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Streams\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/streams/ready\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Actors List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Actors\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/actors\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Pods List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Pods\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/pods\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: GlobusProxy HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: GlobusProxy\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/globus-proxy/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Workflows HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/workflows/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Workflows\n  - name: Workflows Groups List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Workflows\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/workflows/groups\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Authenticator HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Authenticator\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/oauth2/hello\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Authenticator Tokens Create ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Authenticator\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/oauth2/tokens\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    method: POST\n    headers:\n      Content-type: application/json\n    body: '{\"username\": \"${pods:secrets:AUTHN_USERNAME}\", \"password\": \"${pods:secrets:AUTHN_PASSWORD}\", \"grant_type\": \"password\"}'\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n"
            }
          },
          "networking": {
            "default": {
              "protocol": "http",
              "port": 8080,
              "tapis_auth": true,
              "tapis_auth_allowed_users": [
                "*"
              ],
              "tapis_auth_return_path": "/",
              "tapis_ui_uri_redirect": true,
              "tapis_ui_uri_description": "Gatus - full Tapis service status board (postgres-backed)"
            }
          },
          "healthchecks": {
            "readiness": {
              "http_get_path": "/health",
              "http_get_port": 8080,
              "initial_delay_seconds": 5,
              "period_seconds": 10
            },
            "liveness": {
              "http_get_path": "/health",
              "http_get_port": 8080,
              "initial_delay_seconds": 30,
              "period_seconds": 15
            },
            "networking_requires_ready": true
          },
          "resources": {
            "cpu_request": 250,
            "cpu_limit": 1000,
            "mem_request": 256,
            "mem_limit": 1024
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "tag": "tapis-postgres",
    "commit_message": "Full Tapis status board (21 checks / 15 services) + Postgres 17 - the forever one. History survives restarts; no tapisvolume required. Required at instantiation: BASE_URL, JWT, AUTHN_USERNAME, AUTHN_PASSWORD.",
    "description": "Two-pod stack: internal-only Postgres 17 + gatus rendering the full Tapis status board. Postgres replaces the tapisvolume/SQLite requirement of gatus:tapis - check history persists across app restarts. PG password auto-generated per stack."
  }
}

docs {
  ## Gatus full Tapis status board + Postgres — `tapis-postgres`

  `gatus:tapis` merged with the `v5.36.0-postgres` stack: same 21 checks across 15 services
  (rendered from tapis/status-config-builder), but `storage.type: postgres` in the `db`
  member replaces SQLite-on-a-tapisvolume. **The /data volume requirement is gone** — history
  lives in Postgres and survives app restarts and upgrades.

  ### Fill these at instantiation (stack secret_map)
  | key | required | what |
  |-----|----------|------|
  | `BASE_URL` | yes | tenant base, e.g. `https://tacc.tapis.io` |
  | `JWT` | yes | a **user** JWT (not a service account) for the auth-required list checks |
  | `AUTHN_USERNAME` / `AUTHN_PASSWORD` | yes | user creds for the Authenticator token-create check |
  | `PG_PASSWORD` | auto | `${pods:random:32}`, generated once per stack |

  `DISPLAY` / `HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL` / `SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL` stay **member-level** optional
  placeholders (defaults `Tapis` / `15s` / `60s`) — they resolve from their defaults at pod
  start, so the from-template wizard only prompts for the four required stack secrets.

  ### How the per-tenant secrets reach the config
  Required values live on the **stack** (`${:?...}` → wizard prompts); the app member's
  secret_map carries `${stack:secrets:KEY}` *references*, resolved at pod start, and
  `interpolate_config_content` then fills `${pods:secrets:KEY}` into config.yaml before
  mount. The DB password takes the env route instead (`GATUS_DB_*` + gatus's own `${VAR}`
  expansion) because `compile_member_stack_refs` doesn't walk config_content — and it keeps
  the password out of the rendered ConfigMap.

  ### Heads-up on the JWT
  Same as `gatus:tapis`: when the JWT expires the auth-required checks flip red (401) even if
  the service is healthy. Rotate the stack secret, or use `tapis-lite` (public checks only,
  no JWT at all).

  ### Why key=value DSN instead of postgres://
  `${pods:random:32}` draws from `a-zA-Z0-9!@#$%^&*` — `@`, `#`, `%` corrupt a URL. lib/pq's
  keyword form with the password single-quoted is safe for that charset.
}
